\* TIER-2 CERT LEG — Mutation 4 (AbortGuardEnabled = FALSE). EXPECT: VIOLATION.
\*
\* Designed harm: no abort finality => the TLC-1 defect returns — a crash-after-durable-
\* ABORT resurrects and completes an aborted activation via stale acks, violating `I25`
\* (`AbortFinality`). This is the mutation that guards the ONE protocol defect TLC found
\* that nine human review rounds missed (§7.3); it must fire at the certified bounds or
\* the certification is worthless. 14-state trace at the large bounds (§6).
\*
\* @MAXMSGS@ is substituted by the tlc-cert workflow from the `cert_msgs` dispatch input.
SPECIFICATION Spec

SYMMETRY Sym

CONSTRAINT
CertConstraint

CONSTANTS
Stages = {s1, s2}
MaxEpoch = 1
MaxRId = 1
MaxAttempt = 2
MaxPos = 1
MaxCrashes = 1
MaxCkpt = 2
MaxMsgs = @MAXMSGS@
EnableUnservable = TRUE
ResetTruncates = TRUE
AttemptFencing = TRUE
AbortGuardEnabled = FALSE
RestartDerivesByMax = TRUE

INVARIANTS
Inv
